  "solution": "Điều kiện xác định: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Khi đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>log</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≥</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇔</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>So với điều kiện <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> ta được <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> hoặc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Tập nghiệm của bất phương trình đã cho là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>∪</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.",
